flowchart TD
    A[Start crawl pipeline] --> B[Read configs/labels.yaml]
    B --> C[Load labels, keywords, target count, sources]
    C --> D[Count current raw and cleaned images]
    D --> E{Label already enough?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Skip this label]
    E -- No --> G[Select shuffled keyword subset]
    G --> H{Source}
    H -- Naver --> I[Run AutoCrawler wrapper]
    H -- DuckDuckGo --> J[Run DDGS image search]
    I --> K[Download images to temporary crawl run]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Move/copy images into data/raw/label]
    L --> M[Write crawl metadata CSV]
    M --> N{More labels missing?}
    N -- Yes --> D
    N -- No --> O[Finish crawl round]

